#: ../../source/docs/common-sitl-testing-osd.rst:12
#: 12381600361d4ed9be5122c053aaa342 2cd1ea34f3db4bb49cfc4c7ea753b703
#: 6ab96552869a4dbca6e3a80759c6cde3 964ef12994534cbdb966ced4f530298b
#: ac1314b751cf47c792ea7d89c5289e76
msgid ""
"MSP OSD functionality can be tested and panel items adjusted without "
"autopilot or video hardware using the :ref:`Software In The Loop (SITL) "
"simulator <dev:sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` setup. Follow those "
"SITL-Instructions to setup a simulation environment. Run the simulator on "
"current source code using ``--osdmsp`` option to build the OSD code into the"
" simulator. For example, for a plane simulation:"
msgstr ""
"无需飞控或视频硬件，可使用 :ref:`软件在环（SITL）仿真器 <dev:sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>`"
" 测试 MSP OSD 功能并调整面板元素。按照 SITL 说明搭建仿真环境。使用 ``--osdmsp`` 选项在当前源代码上运行仿真器，以将 OSD"
" 代码编译进仿真器。例如，飞机仿真："

#: ../../source/docs/common-sitl-testing-osd.rst:18
#: 0d89c3c1367c4b85bb585433ee787f2d 45ccdcd2610445b39a5161d25f35811d
#: 819f79b8136448d4888c0fd44b704079 8e36dfec464a4fc8868dfa5172ec42c8
#: d9dc6ca1a24c4af5b2ead5237a59551f
msgid ""
"A graphical DJI style MSP OSD simulation in a separate window will be opened"
" with the other simulation windows using a typical set of OSD panel "
"parameters, located at libraries/AP_MSP/Tools/osdtest.parm . Then the OSD "
"elements can be customized by their parameters using the  MSP OSD emulation "
"program to visualize the OSD."
msgstr ""
"使用典型的 OSD 面板参数（位于 "
"libraries/AP_MSP/Tools/osdtest.parm），将在其他仿真窗口中打开一个独立窗口，显示图形化 DJI 风格的 MSP OSD"
" 仿真。然后可通过 MSP OSD 仿真程序使用参数自定义 OSD 元素并进行可视化预览。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sitl-testing-osd.rst:20
#: 0b13aee23f144bd78c5b36af3ae81a7a 120495deafa743b799c786f2eaaa336a
#: 5ebe5ac3e577405c8fd6e07f9e5f10dd 86a03c8aead54834b4e1cc935f16a4e2
#: daed4410bba84e79ac58ca1e09b86c1f
msgid ""
"You could also use these parameters to initially setup the MSP OSD panels "
"and positions for use with goggles, but still need to correctly configure "
"the Serial port and other parameters for the particular OSD system."
msgstr "您也可以使用这些参数初步设置 MSP OSD 面板及其位置，以便与护目镜配合使用，但仍需为特定 OSD 系统正确配置串口及其他参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sitl-testing-osd.rst:28
#: 6ea582ce6d984b939307dd6c7f20bd2e 7b25e05d010f46648f1086a40c5d12e0
#: 83c5c8a063db4fc6a7b5e0d5f25d132e 9535e9bfcf9e4ca99a270f4e110461fe
#: f217776ca62341f4b3710791278e9be9
msgid ""
"By changing the OSD panel items' parameters, a live update of their "
"placement can be seen in this emulator."
msgstr "通过修改 OSD 面板元素的参数，可在此仿真器中实时查看其位置变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sitl-testing-osd.rst:31
#: 614e7c79417b4759af6dee874cfe251b 659e1d3daece4b459e8565ac5975321a
#: 6f847930981a41949a495eb12069bd15 ab19778fd98c49b69cc27ffab849aad5
#: ea417eedf9fa4e61a3846e91d8fc98b8
